1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,089
Do this one hour before bed, and you will sleep so much better.

2
00:00:05,439 --> 00:00:09,578
One. Dim the lights. Bright light tells your brain it's still daytime.

3
00:00:10,828 --> 00:00:13,757
Two. Put your phone away. Read a book instead.

4
00:00:15,007 --> 00:00:17,306
Three. Keep your room cool and dark.

5
00:00:18,556 --> 00:00:23,415
Four. Wind down. Stretch, breathe slowly, and write tomorrow's to-do list.

6
00:00:24,765 --> 00:00:27,848
Which step will you try tonight? Tell me in the comments.

7
00:00:29,498 --> 00:00:32,260
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

